      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/fort_lawn_south_carolina"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Railroad conductors reportedly announced the stop by calling out, \"Everybody off for Fort's Lawn!\" to their passengers.",
